guinevere: Ah, Percivel, the failed knight. Bold of you to return to Camlann after your desertion.
It is a pleasure to see you as well, Your Majesty. Could I ask how you've been faring since your internment here at Camlann?
guinevere: I suppose I am as well as I could possibly be in these circumstances. My position, however, is not one that allows me to spend time speaking with those no longer of my kingdom. Off you go, now.
set {convo_progress.guinevere.gwenGreeted} = true